We additionally provide a Zenodo archival repository with the following:

(1) the E3SM code (hbc2 development branch) used for the runs;
(2) the code to reproduce the analysis and plots in the manuscript;
(3) instructions to reproduce the runs in the manuscript;
(4) instructions to retrieve the data files from runs;
(5) the post-processed data used to make the plots in (2).

The following subfolders correspond to the items above, in order:

01_e3sm-hbc2_code
02_plots
03_runs
04_archive
05_data
